      "description": "Experience every moment of summer sports season with Yahoo Fantasy Sports! See why millions of fans choose our platform to play Fantasy Baseball, Fantasy Basketball, Fantasy Football, Fantasy Hockey, Daily Fantasy (DFS), and join our bracket contest. Whether you're drafting your diamond dynasty or managing your tournament brackets, we provide the tools you need to play and win.\n\n2026 FANTASY BASEBALL: EASIER & MORE FUN\n\nJoin or create a league today to get ahead for the 2026 season with tools designed to help you manage your team from Opening Day to the playoffs:\n\n• Upgraded Commissioner Draft Tools: Everything you need to manage your draft is now all in the app, all in one place. Easily edit your league’s draft order, schedule and view draft times, choose draft formats, and more.  \n• Draft With Friends: Instantly invite up to seven people to join you in a free public league. All you have to do is enter a free public draft room and tap the \"Add Friends Pre-Draft\" button to invite people to join your draft!  \n• Start Active Players: A free feature that sets your lineup with a single tap, filling it with healthy players who have games scheduled so you never leave points on the bench.  \n• A Social-First Community: Follow, react to, and talk with other fans about every big play from the games that matter most to your fantasy season.\n\nSEASON-LONG LEAGUE MANAGEMENT\n\nLead your teams across all major sports with a robust suite of management tools. Join public leagues to compete with fans worldwide or create a private league to coordinate trades and talk trash with your crew in our social fantasy feed. \n\nADVANCED ROSTER & DRAFT UTILITIES\n\n• Real-Time Live Scores: Follow every play with scoring updates that reflect your fantasy matchups as they happen.  \n• The Waiver Wire: Submit claims for available players or manage your Free Agent Acquisition Budget (FAAB) to outbid rivals.  \n• Mock Drafts: Prepare for draft day by practicing your strategy in live draft rooms against other managers.  \n• Customizable Alerts: Set personalized notifications for game starts, scoring plays, roster news, and trade offers.\n\nDAILY FANTASY SPORTS (DFS)\n\nExperience the thrill of a new draft every day without the season-long commitment:\n\n• Flexible Contests: Enter daily or weekly salary cap contests for NFL, NBA, MLB, and NHL.  \n• Secure Platform: Compete for prizes with verified distributions in a secure environment\n\nYAHOO FANTASY PLUS (Premium Tools)\n\nGain a competitive edge with optional subscription-based tools (Subscription Required):\n\n• Draft Kits: Expert rankings, tiers, and real-time analysis tailored to your league.  \n• Assistant GM: Optimize your lineup with win-probability insights.  \n• Instant Mock Draft: Test strategies and roster constructions in seconds.\n\nCONNECT & CELEBRATE\n\n• Fantasy Feed: Communicate with league members through text, images, and GIFs to coordinate trades or talk trash.  \n• Public & Private Leagues: Join a public league to compete with fans worldwide or create a private league for your crew.\n\nDownload Yahoo Fantasy Sports today and join the community.\n\nYahoo Fantasy is committed to responsible play. For more information visit [https://help.yahoo.com/kb/daily-fantasy/SLN27857.html](https://help.yahoo.com/kb/daily-fantasy/SLN27857.html)",
